sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Data Scientist<br/>(Python Code)
    participant SDK as Kubeflow SDK<br/>(TrainerClient)
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Operator as Kubeflow Trainer<br/>Operator
    participant Pod as Training Pod<br/>28080/TCP HTTP
    participant S3 as S3 Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant vLLM as vLLM Sidecar<br/>8234/TCP HTTP
    participant MR as Model Registry<br/>443 or 8080/TCP
    participant HF as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over User,HF: Flow 1: Training Job Submission

    User->>SDK: trainer.train(train_func, ...)
    SDK->>K8s: POST TrainJob CR<br/>Auth: kubeconfig / SA token
    K8s->>Operator: Watch event (TrainJob created)
    Operator->>Pod: Create training pods<br/>(with injected instrumentation)
    loop Progression Polling
        Operator->>Pod: GET / (metrics)<br/>Port 28080/TCP HTTP<br/>No Auth
        Pod-->>Operator: JSON metrics response
    end
    Pod-->>K8s: Update TrainJob status
    K8s-->>SDK: Watch status update
    SDK-->>User: Job completed

    Note over Pod,S3: Flow 2: S3 Cloud Checkpoint Upload

    Pod->>Pod: Checkpoint callback triggered
    Pod->>S3: Upload checkpoint artifacts<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS<br/>Auth: AWS credentials
    S3-->>Pod: Upload confirmed

    Note over Pod,vLLM: Flow 3: Speculative Decoding (DATA_ONLY Mode)

    Pod->>vLLM: POST hidden state extraction<br/>HTTP/8234 localhost<br/>No Auth
    vLLM-->>Pod: Hidden state data
    Pod->>Pod: Write to shared PVC volume

    Note over User,MR: Flow 4: Model Registration

    User->>SDK: hub.register_model(...)
    SDK->>MR: HTTP/HTTPS request<br/>Port 443 or 8080<br/>Auth: user_token (optional)
    MR-->>SDK: Model registered
    SDK-->>User: Registration confirmed
